### Transactions API Contract
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/controle_ja_api/v1
@token = replace-with-access-token
@transactionId = replace-with-transaction-id
@accountId = replace-with-account-id
@targetAccountId = replace-with-target-account-id
@categoryId = replace-with-category-id
@vehicleId = replace-with-vehicle-id
@gasStationId = replace-with-gas-station-id
@start = 1717100000000
@end = 1748636000000

### Controller summary
### TransactionController concentra criação, consulta, edição e exclusão de lançamentos.
### O controller delega as decisões de negócio para TransactionService e retorna DTOs já
### preparados para o app. Ele também expõe um endpoint auxiliar para detalhes de lançamentos
### vinculados a veículos.

### Existing controller decisions
### - Toda rota exige Authorization Bearer token.
### - GET /transactions exige start e end em epoch milliseconds.
### - PUT e DELETE usam operationScope com default ONLY_THIS.
### - updateFuture foi removido para evitar dois parâmetros controlando o mesmo escopo.
### - OperationScope decide se a alteração atinge somente o lançamento, futuros ou todos.
### - Transações de veículo são processadas em processor separado.
### - Primeiro abastecimento não entra no cálculo de KM/L porque não existe odômetro anterior confiável.
### - Categoria pai de veículo exige subcategoria filha, independente do tipo da transação.
### - Odômetro é validado para lançamentos que atualizam a quilometragem do veículo.

### OperationScope values
### ONLY_THIS: aplica somente ao lançamento/parcela selecionado.
### FROM_THIS_FORWARD: aplica ao lançamento/parcela selecionado e futuros da mesma série quando suportado.
### ALL: aplica ao grupo inteiro da compra/série quando suportado.

### Common error contract
### 400 Bad Request
### {
###   "code": 400,
###   "title": "Erro | Acesso negado | Erro de Validação",
###   "message": "Mensagem de regra ou validação"
### }
###
### 404 Not Found
### {
###   "code": "404",
###   "title": "Erro",
###   "message": "Transação não encontrada ou já foi excluída."
### }

### Transaction request contract
### {
###   "name": "string obrigatório",
###   "description": "string opcional",
###   "type": "RECEITA | DESPESA | TRANSFERENCIA obrigatório",
###   "amount": "decimal obrigatório",
###   "date": "epoch milliseconds obrigatório",
###   "accountId": "uuid obrigatório para conta origem",
###   "categoryId": "uuid obrigatório quando aplicável",
###   "installments": "integer opcional; usado para parcelamento",
###   "paid": "boolean",
###   "targetAccountId": "uuid obrigatório para transferência ou pagamento de fatura",
###   "creditCardId": "uuid opcional para despesa de cartão",
###   "targetInvoiceId": "uuid opcional para pagamento de fatura",
###   "isFixed": "boolean",
###   "recurrenceFrequency": "frequência opcional",
###   "recurrenceEndDate": "epoch milliseconds opcional",
###   "vehicleId": "uuid opcional",
###   "currentOdometer": "decimal opcional; obrigatório para eventos de veículo que atualizam KM; aceita até 1 casa decimal",
###   "liters": "decimal opcional; usado em abastecimento",
###   "fuelType": "GASOLINA | ETANOL opcional",
###   "efficiency": "decimal opcional; calculado quando possível",
###   "drivingPredominance": "CITY | HIGHWAY | MIXED opcional",
###   "gasStationId": "uuid opcional"
### }

### Transaction response contract
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "name": "string",
###   "type": "RECEITA | DESPESA | TRANSFERENCIA | TRANSFERENCIA_SAIDA | TRANSFERENCIA_ENTRADA",
###   "amount": "decimal",
###   "date": "epoch milliseconds",
###   "paid": "boolean",
###   "categoryId": "uuid|null",
###   "categoryName": "string|null",
###   "accountId": "uuid|null",
###   "accountName": "string|null",
###   "parentTransactionId": "uuid|null",
###   "efficiency": "decimal|null",
###   "vehicleName": "string|null",
###   "vehicleId": "uuid|null",
###   "liters": "decimal|null",
###   "currentOdometer": "decimal|null",
###   "fuelType": "GASOLINA | ETANOL | null",
###   "drivingPredominance": "CITY | HIGHWAY | MIXED | null",
###   "gasStationId": "uuid|null",
###   "gasStationName": "string|null",
###   "creditCardId": "uuid|null",
###   "targetInvoiceId": "uuid|null",
###   "recurrenceRuleId": "uuid|null",
###   "virtual": "boolean",
###   "isFixed": "boolean|null",
###   "recurrenceFrequency": "string|null"
### }

### Create transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abastecimento",
  "description": "Opcional",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "installments": 1,
  "paid": true,
  "targetAccountId": null,
  "creditCardId": null,
  "targetInvoiceId": null,
  "isFixed": false,
  "recurrenceFrequency": null,
  "recurrenceEndDate": null,
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "currentOdometer": 50400.7,
  "liters": 40.0,
  "fuelType": "GASOLINA",
  "efficiency": null,
  "drivingPredominance": "CITY",
  "gasStationId": "{{gasStationId}}"
}

### Expected 200 response
### Transaction response contract.

### List transactions by period
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?start={{start}}&end={{end}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [ Transaction response contract ]

### Get transaction by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Transaction response contract.

### Update only selected transaction/installment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abastecimento atualizado",
  "description": "Opcional",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 210.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "installments": 1,
  "paid": true,
  "isFixed": false,
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "currentOdometer": 50400.7,
  "liters": 40.0,
  "fuelType": "GASOLINA",
  "drivingPredominance": "CITY",
  "gasStationId": "{{gasStationId}}"
}

### Update selected transaction/installment and future items
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Assinatura atualizada",
  "description": "Opcional",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "paid": true,
  "isFixed": true,
  "recurrenceFrequency": "MONTHLY",
  "recurrenceEndDate": null
}

### Update all supported items in the purchase/series
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Compra parcelada atualizada",
  "description": "Opcional",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 120.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "installments": 10,
  "paid": true,
  "isFixed": false
}

### Expected 200 response for updates
### Transaction response contract.

### Delete only selected transaction/installment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete selected transaction/installment and future items
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete all supported items in the purchase/series
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}?operationScope=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response for deletes
### {
###   "message": "Registro excluído com sucesso."
### }

### List vehicle transaction details by period
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/vehicle/details?start={{start}}&end={{end}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [ Transaction response contract with vehicle fields ]
### Notes:
### - Returns direct vehicle expenses paid from bank/cash accounts.
### - Returns credit-card installments allocated to vehicles by invoice month.
### - Does not return the artificial "Despesas de veículos do mês" consolidated row.
### - Credit-card installment rows include targetInvoiceId/creditCardId and accountName ending with "(Fatura)".
